walls~
   The walls are made from large, smooth stone blocks. They're rather tall;
this tomb belongs to someone important.
~
E
corbels ceiling gems stars up~
   The ceiling is corbeled with overlapping stonework to come to a point at the
top. Gems of many colors are set into it.
~
E
statue~
The statue has a heroic pose. It stands guard over a lone sarcophagus.
~
E
sarcophagus~
   The stone sarcophagus is carved with a human likeness. Finishing details are
done in bronze and the whole thing is supported on a bronze pedestal.
~
E
stonework~
The building is made with masterful stonework to survive the ages.
~
E
pedestal bronze~
